id: autoplay-unmute
section: Media and sound
item: Autoplay media with sound off (T-603): a muted clip plays by itself, and the page unmuting it with no tap gets it paused
shells: enyo
prefs: jihad.media.autoplayWithSound=false
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-media-test.html?src=clip60av.webm&wide=1&unmute=30000
kit: cavekit-gre-widgets.md R1
wait rect v 20
calibrate 'sel:#status'
wait text status playing 15
wait text status paused 40
shoot paused-on-unmute
